This is an RPG game made entirely on Java utilizing a graph implementation using maps to form a world and allow the user to explore, fight, and discover what is within.

All files needed to run the game from start are included in this repository.
INSTRUCTIONS:
1. Download all files from this repository, whether zipped or not.
2. If zipped, unzip into the desired folder.
3. Within your desired IDE, open all .java files.
4. Navigate to the "CSCI_200_Final_Project.java" class and compile if needed.
5. Press run. The game should start on its own. 
